T*
(* Total Differential \(dz\): For z = f\(x, y\), dz = \(dz/dx\) dx + \(dz/dy\) dy. Quantifies) Tj
T*
(the first-order linear approximation of change delta z due to small increments delta) Tj
T*
(x and delta y.) Tj
T*
(* Chain Rule for Composite Functions: If z = f\(u, v\) where u = phi\(x, y\) and v =) Tj
T*
(psi\(x, y\):) Tj
T*
(dz/dx = \(dz/du\)*\(du/dx\) + \(dz/dv\)*\(dv/dx\)) Tj
T*
(dz/dy = \(dz/du\)*\(du/dy\) + \(dz/dv\)*\(dv/dy\).) Tj
