T*
(* Critical Points: Points \(a, b\) where both first partial derivatives vanish) Tj
T*
(simultaneously: fx\(a, b\) = 0 and fy\(a, b\) = 0.) Tj
T*
(* Second Derivative Test: Compute second partial derivatives at \(a, b\):) Tj
T*
(r = fxx = d^2f / dx^2, s = fxy = d^2f / \(dx dy\), t = fyy = d^2f / dy^2.) Tj
T*
(Discriminant: Delta = r * t - s^2.) Tj
T*
(1. Local Minimum: If Delta > 0 and r > 0.) Tj
T*
(2. Local Maximum: If Delta > 0 and r < 0.) Tj
T*
(3. Saddle Point \(Neither Max nor Min\): If Delta < 0.) Tj
T*
(4. Inconclusive Test: If Delta = 0 \(higher order investigations required\).) Tj
T*
(* Lagrange's Method of Undetermined Multipliers: To find extrema of f\(x, y, z\)) Tj
T*
(subject to constraint phi\(x, y, z\) = 0:) Tj
T*
(Construct auxiliary Lagrange function L\(x, y, z, lambda\) = f\(x, y, z\) + lambda * phi\(x,) Tj
T*
(y, z\).) Tj
T*
(Solve the system of 4 equations: dL/dx = 0, dL/dy = 0, dL/dz = 0, dL/d\(lambda\) = phi\(x,) Tj
T*
(y, z\) = 0.) Tj
